This package implements browser inference for BrainLesion/AURORA v0.2.7
(https://github.com/BrainLesion/AURORA, Apache-2.0), developed by the BrainLesion
team (Buchner JA, Kofler F, Peeken JC, Menze BH, Wiestler B, et al.).

The pretrained model weights (t1c-o_best.tar from Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.10557069,
converted to aurora-t1c-o_best.onnx) are distributed separately under CC-BY-4.0
and fetched at runtime from the pinned Hugging Face revision in model.manifest.json.
